  "notes": "selfoss RSS reader. Dark charcoal sidebar with teal 'Mark as read' button and teal vertical accent stripe; main area has a faint diagonal crosshatch texture. Each article row has a colored square source favicon letter, a left teal border marking unread items (read items have greyed titles and no border), saturated solid tag pills colour-coded per tag (color changeable via sidebar swatches). Clicking a row expands content inline with an action bar (Unstar, Mark as read, Open, Twitter/Facebook/Pocket/email share)."
